<title>FRANCE: France Telecom 1996 key results.</title>
<headline>France Telecom 1996 key results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				     2.1  vs	     9.2</p>
<p>    Net income before special items	 14.5  vs	    14.0</p>
<p>    Revenues				     151.3  vs	   147.8</p>
<p>    Gross margin				  68.8  vs	    66.0</p>
<p>    EBIT					    30.3  vs	    29.6</p>
<p>    Financial income expenses		  4.9  vs	     7.2</p>
<p>    Non-recurring items in 1996			     after tax</p>
<p>    - depreciation of fixed assets	  34.6		  26.8</p>
<p>- reversal of civil servant pension</p>
<p>	plan accrual				17.5		  14.4</p>
<p>    total charge				  17.1		  12.4</p>
<p>    BALANCE SHEET				1996		   1995</p>
<p>    Intangible assets			  212.8   vs	  229.3</p>
<p>    Current assets				48.7   vs	   51.9</p>
<p>    Financial assets			     3.2   vs	    2.4</p>
<p>    Total					  264.7   vs	  283.6</p>
<p>    Total equity				  78.5   vs	  136.3</p>
<p>    Minority interests			   1.0   vs	    0.4</p>
<p>    Financial debt				73.1   vs	   87.5</p>
<p>    Operating debt				48.6   vs	   41.5</p>
<p>    Provisions				    26.0   vs	   18.0</p>
<p>    One-off payment to French state	 37.5   vs	    nil</p>
<p>    Net debt					69.9   vs	   85.0</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure			 26.2   vs	   30.4</p>
<p>    Acquisitions and investments	    10.7   vs	    1.2</p>
<p>    Cash from operations			55.7   vs	   45.3</p>
<p>NOTE - France Telecom gave the figures during a</p>
<p>news conference.</p>
</text>
